      "title": "Price target increased by 8.0% to ₹1,287",
      "body": "Up from ₹1,192, the current price target is an average from 5 analysts. New target price is 17% above last closing price of ₹1,100. Stock is up 67% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹27.05 for next year compared to ₹17.55 last year.",
