      "body": "The board of directors of Gabriel India Limited at its meeting held on May 27, 2026, Recommended the Final Dividend for the year ended March 31, 2026 of INR 3.10 per equity share, subject to the approval of shareholders at the ensuing Annual General Meeting of the Company. The Final Dividend for Fiscal Year 2025-26 shall be paid to the shareholders on or before September 24, 2026.",
